street or streets within neighborhoods.  Avoid
locations adjacent to major thoroughfares or
arterials.

They should be near parks, trails, and other
recreation facilities to provide combined recreation
facilities.

Middle and high schools should be planned as
combined campuses, facilitating opportunities for
